      "rationale": "Medication-related complexity is a reasonable axis. Values are well grounded: acne row correctly 1 (adapalene/doxycycline as new meds), URI 0. The MI follow-up scored 0 despite beta-blocker/statin is arguably a definitional choice (new vs continued meds), still defensible."
    },
